    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d123-a2">

                <pb facs="0289" n="193" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg193"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 2888.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Smithers.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Smithers</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Chung-king:</hi></p>
                <p>Have demanded from Yamên immediate and energetic action. Demand ample redress
                    from local officials.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
